    "Wi-Fi 6E is not inferred from Wi-Fi 6; 6 GHz also depends on adapter, AP and local regulatory permission.",
    "Authentication is performed by a native OS provider."
  ],
  "technology": "Wi-Fi 6",
  "standard": "IEEE 802.11ax"
}
